      "description": "<h1>Changelog</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>General optimizations (Mod loads in ~100ms)</li>\n<li>Fixed Epic’s All in One incompatibility.\n<ul>\n<li>Epic AIO was overwriting my filters, so I decided to load the filters last.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Sight names/description now applies to all locales, even if one isn’t really configured.</li>\n<li>Added sights to static loot pool.\n<ul>\n<li>Didn’t have time to test this. Let me know if there’s a need to increase spawn chance.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Added missing Anti sight (It had locale, but no item registered)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/yuyuimoe/SamSwat-AnimeSights-4.0/compare/1.0.0...1.3.0\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/yuyuimoe/SamSwat-AnimeSights-4.0/compare/1.0.0...1.3.0</a></p>\n",
